It is time for lunch.
The food is on the table.
Now I make my first smørrebrød.
I take the rye bread and a knife.
I cut a slice and put the cheese on it.
I take a bite.
It tastes lovely.
Then I look at the new liver paté.
It looks a little strange.
I take a new slice.
Bravely, I spread it on the bread.
It is a very Danish lunch.
I am a little nervous.
I taste it.
But wow...
I actually like it!
The liver paté tastes fantastic on the bread.
I like Danish food.
"Not bad, Denmark," I laugh.
